      "title": "curl: a CVE dispute",
      "url": "https://daniel.haxx.se/blog/2026/06/24/a-cve-dispute/",
      "discuss_url": "https://lobste.rs/s/1pdfex",
      "score": 99,
      "comments": 34,
      "author": "eugeny",
      "published": "2026-08-31T10:38:12Z",
      "bullets": [
        "Curl maintainers dispute bogus CVE assignments issued by third-party CNAs without upstream coordination or genuine security impact.",
        "Unverified CVEs degrade vulnerability scanner fidelity, driving alert fatigue and wasted remediation cycles for enterprise security teams.",
        "The dispute underscores systemic governance flaws across the CVE and NVD ecosystem regarding CNA accountability and dispute resolution."
      ]
    },
